flowchart TB
  %% High-level architecture
  Users[MSLs / HCPs / Medical Affairs / Patients]
  Platform[MedVerse Platform - Web and Desktop]
  Agents[RAG + Agents Layer]
  Hubs[Literature / Trials / Expert Hub / KB]
  DataSources[External Sources and CRM]
  Infra[Cloud Infra & Services]

  Users -->|use| Platform
  Platform --> Agents
  Agents -->|retrieve| Hubs
  Hubs -->|ingest from| DataSources
  Agents -->|call| Infra
  Platform -->|store/publish| Infra

  classDef core fill:#005EB8,stroke:#003a75,color:#fff,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef hub fill:#e6f7ff,stroke:#005EB8,color:#003a75,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef ext fill:#ffffff,stroke:#005EB8,color:#003a75,stroke-width:1px;

  class Platform,Agents core;
  class Hubs hub;
  class DataSources,Users ext;
